            "ext_alt_text": "Roadway Traffic Advisory\nGetting picked up/dropped off?\nConsider using the upper-level (departures) roadway instead when the lower-level (arrivals) roadway is congested when approaching the airport's entrance or vice versa.\nHere's Why:\nIt's easy to move between the upper and lower levels of our terminals (via an elevator, staircase, escalator), so opt for the less congested level to help traffic flow.\nThank you. Broward County, Florida.",
